```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization update --help
Update a Scherzo Cloud organization

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization update [OPTIONS] <--display-name <DISPLAY_NAME>|--slug <SLUG>> <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --display-name <DISPLAY_NAME>  Set the organization display name
      --slug <SLUG>                  Set the exact organization slug
      --json                         Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                         Print help

```
